        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Phase 3- Auburn Woods Now Available to Reserve.\r\n\r\nDiscover Auburn Woods, an exclusive collection of luxurious new homes nestled within the historic wooded grounds of Auburn House, just moments from Malahide Village. Blending timeless elegance with contemporary design, this prestigious development offers a unique opportunity to live in a tranquil, nature-filled setting while enjoying the convenience of one of Dublin’s most sought-after locations.\r\n\r\nLocation & Lifestyle\r\nAuburn Woods is set within 12.5 acres of beautifully landscaped grounds, featuring protected woodlands, scenic walking trails, and a restored walled garden. Situated next to Malahide Castle & Gardens, and mere moments to Malahide Beach, vibrant cafés, boutiques, and excellent transport links, residents can enjoy an unparalleled lifestyle by the coast.\r\n\r\nA Prime Address in Malahide\r\nMalahide is renowned for its coastal charm, excellent schools, and top-tier sports facilities, including golf courses, tennis clubs, and a full-service marina. With Dublin Airport just 10 minutes away and the DART offering quick city centre access, Auburn Woods is ideal for families, , and downsizers seeking a high-quality, well-connected home.\r\n\r\nHomes Designed for Modern Living\r\nOffering a selection of 1, 2, 3 & 4-bedroom homes, including houses, own-door duplexes and loft apartments, Auburn Woods caters to all life stages. Each home is architecturally designed with expansive glazing, high ceilings, and carefully designed layouts, maximizing light, space, and connection to nature."
      },
